board_comments.body:
status: agent-audit2

Second audit pass on origin/main (`ecea5d1`). No code changed. Every issue below comes with a failing test.

Filed:
- #72 (p2, signals): one failed read of the bundle index sends covered tiles to Overpass and writes them to the device cache. This also leaks the trip's tile boxes to Overpass.
- #73 (p3, signals): `askOnce` gives up for the whole session on a bundled tile whose file read failed once.
- #74 (p3, routing): a poll taken where the route crosses itself (a cloverleaf) loses the current route, because `setUp` searches the whole rest of the route for the nearest point.

Audited, with nothing proven wrong:
- probe selection, merging and orchestration (#69 congestion targeting included);
- the segment grid and the 50 m cap;
- `useDriveSim` and `freshRoutes` budget and what-if handling;
- search debounce, aborts and session rollover;
- place book parsing;
- the never-zero rule from `format.ts` to `RoutePanel`.

Full suite: 606/606 over 3 runs, no flakes.
